subsections.description:
\[
T \cos \theta - N \sin \theta = m \frac{v^2}{r}
\]

Solve (1) and (2) for T and N:
\begin{align*}
N \cos \theta + T \sin \theta &= mg \\
T \cos \theta - N \sin \theta &= m \frac{v^2}{r}
\end{align*}
Solve these simultaneously to express T and N symbolically.

